WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.656
Press Control, Shift and 4 to start a
snip.

2
00:00:05.226 --> 00:00:08.326
Drag to select the part of your screen you
want.

3
00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:13.475
A review card shows your picture, already
copied to your clipboard.

4
00:00:14.045 --> 00:00:17.416
Nothing is uploaded until you press Send.

5
00:00:17.986 --> 00:00:21.858
Then the card confirms the picture was
sent to your project.
